note right of DataStore
  Eager Singleton instance.
  Holds shared in-memory maps.
  No persistence across restarts.
end note
note right of AppConfig
  Lazy Singleton accessor.
  Stores organisation name and contact email.
end note
note right of EventRegistration
  Stores eventId and volunteerId to link one
  Volunteer registration to one RescueEvent.
  These are ID-based links, so dependencies
  are shown rather than object associations.
  Events and volunteers with registrations
  cannot be deleted.
end note
note right of CommunicationModule
  The module has connect* methods,
  but ControlPanelController's normal
  startup path only creates the
  Communication screen. The current
  controllers do not visibly publish
  domain events through these subjects.
  Do not claim end-to-end Observer
  integration without wiring/testing it.
end note
legend bottom
  Phase 1 design elements (MVC + five GoF patterns):
  1. MVC (architectural pattern, not a GoF pattern)
  2. Singleton (GoF)  - DataStore, AppConfig
  3. Factory (GoF)    - DonationFactory
  4. Decorator (GoF)  - DonationDecorator, RecurringDonation, InMemoryOfDonation
  5. Strategy (GoF)   - ChannelStrategy family, VolunteerMatchingStrategy family
  6. Observer (GoF)   - Subject / Observer and observer classes

  Phase 2 (planned only; not implemented in this main tree):
  Command | Adapter | Facade | Template Method | Iterator | State | Proxy
endlegend
@enduml
